{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2fe95e73-1524-8371-be37-4a10de5e3c07",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T09:09:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tariq Patel",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:07:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:07:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I'd like to report a pothole. It's a pretty bad one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:07:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can take that. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:07:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of 392 Ayrault Street. Up on the Hill. Near the edge of the road, on my side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:08:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "392 Ayrault. Okay. How big are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:08:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Big enough. I hit it Monday evening and the tire blew. The rim's bent, too. I had to have the car towed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:08:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. I'm sorry. Let me get this entered. Is it in the travel lane or by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:08:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Travel lane, about a foot out from the curb. [pause] Sorry, I've got the radio on in the kitchen. Let me turn that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:08:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:08:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's better. It's the local station, the news was on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine by me. So, travel lane, a foot from the curb, in front of 392. Anything else about it? Is it deep?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:08:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Six inches, maybe. Sharp edges. It's on the bus route, too, so I imagine the buses are going through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:08:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good to know, that helps get it prioritized. I'll note the bus route in the report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:08:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Can I ask how long repairs usually take? Roughly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:09:01-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It varies. This time of year, with freezing and thawing, we get a lot of them at once. Usually somewhere from a few days to a couple of weeks. Sometimes crews put in a cold patch first, then do a proper fix when the weather warms up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:09:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. That's about what I figured."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:09:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a callback number on the report, in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:09:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's fine. It's 401-555-0166."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:09:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0166. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:09:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tariq Patel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:09:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Mr. Patel. It's in. If you want to file about the tire and the rim, I can transfer you over to the office that handles claims."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:09:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. I'd appreciate that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T09:09:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on one moment while I connect you."
    }
  ],
